==========




=== Test 28: Correlated scalar subquery with inner filter ===
o_total > (SELECT SUM(l_price) FROM lineitem WHERE l_orderkey = o_id AND l_quantity > 20)
Inner SUM where qty>20: (3,550),(5,750). Only order 3 qualifies (700>550)
== Query ==
SELECT o_id, SUM(o_total)
FROM orders
WHERE o_total > (SELECT SUM(l_price) FROM lineitem WHERE l_orderkey = o_id AND l_quantity > 20)
GROUP BY o_id;

Number of output lines, including header: 2

